2. Ported helpers from freebsd-wifibox — BSD-2-Clause

   host/run-bcachefsbox.sh re-implements, in POSIX-sh form, two pieces of
   the freebsd-wifibox supervisor:

     - the internal-defaults-then-source-the-conf pattern of
       load_bhyve_conf_values() (upstream sbin/wifibox:244-265), used for
       the lifecycle conf (nice_priority, stop_wait_max, console);
     - the assert_value_wellformed() / assert_value_ranged_integer() /
       assert_value_yesno() validation helpers (upstream
       sbin/wifibox:510-555), renamed assert_wellformed() /
       assert_ranged_int() and adapted to this script's log/die
